## File and item names

The file names matched against `files` filters are relative to the `translated_rust/` directory.

The function and type names matched against `functions` and `types` filters are absolute paths beginning with `crate::`.  A list of all known items is provided in `ALL_ITEMS.txt`.  Don't try to read the whole file (it may be very long), but if needed you can grep for a specific item to see its canonical name.
